    "description": {
      "value": "Fleets that deliver the last mile can run electric vehicles without waiting for them to charge. Corvanta Mobility builds and assembles electric three-wheeled cargo vehicles in the state of Sao Paulo and operates the battery-exchange stations where a depleted battery is swapped for a charged one. A fleet rents each vehicle for a monthly fee and pays an energy fee every time it swaps a battery. The Series B money is for a second assembly line and for entering four more metropolitan areas.",
